{
  "script_id": "complex",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.16,
      "size": 34560,
      "text": "欢迎来到复数实验！今天我们要探索一个神奇的数学世界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.43,
      "size": 38880,
      "text": "你可能听说过，负数不能开平方。但数学家说：为什么不能？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.06,
      "size": 32976,
      "text": "于是他们发明了虚数单位 i，定义 i 的平方等于负1。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "imaginary-unit",
      "line_id": "imaginary-unit-1",
      "filename": "imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.1,
      "size": 33552,
      "text": "虚数单位 i 满足 i 的平方等于负1，这是它的定义。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "imaginary-unit",
      "line_id": "imaginary-unit-2",
      "filename": "imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.47,
      "size": 23472,
      "text": "有了 i，我们就可以表示负数的平方根了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "imaginary-unit",
      "line_id": "imaginary-unit-3",
      "filename": "imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.08,
      "size": 49248,
      "text": "例如，负4的平方根就是 2i，因为 2i 的平方等于 4 乘以 i 的平方，等于负4。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "imaginary-unit",
      "line_id": "imaginary-unit-4",
      "filename": "imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/imaginary-unit-imaginary-unit-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.14,
      "size": 34272,
      "text": "虚数虽然叫\"虚\"，但它在物理和工程中有非常实际的应用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-number",
      "line_id": "complex-number-1",
      "filename": "complex-number-complex-number-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-number-complex-number-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.92,
      "size": 30672,
      "text": "复数是实数和虚数的组合，写成 a 加 bi 的形式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-number",
      "line_id": "complex-number-2",
      "filename": "complex-number-complex-number-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-number-complex-number-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.91,
      "size": 30528,
      "text": "其中 a 叫做实部，b 叫做虚部，它们都是实数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-number",
      "line_id": "complex-number-3",
      "filename": "complex-number-complex-number-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-number-complex-number-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.58,
      "size": 25344,
      "text": "当 b 等于 0 时，复数就退化为实数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-number",
      "line_id": "complex-number-4",
      "filename": "complex-number-complex-number-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-number-complex-number-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.54,
      "size": 24624,
      "text": "当 a 等于 0 时，复数就是纯虚数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-plane",
      "line_id": "complex-plane-1",
      "filename": "complex-plane-complex-plane-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-plane-complex-plane-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.82,
      "size": 29088,
      "text": "复数可以在平面上表示，这个平面叫做复平面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-plane",
      "line_id": "complex-plane-2",
      "filename": "complex-plane-complex-plane-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-plane-complex-plane-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.15,
      "size": 34416,
      "text": "横轴是实轴，表示实部；纵轴是虚轴，表示虚部。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-plane",
      "line_id": "complex-plane-3",
      "filename": "complex-plane-complex-plane-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-plane-complex-plane-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.67,
      "size": 26784,
      "text": "每个复数对应平面上的一个点，反过来也成立。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "complex-plane",
      "line_id": "complex-plane-4",
      "filename": "complex-plane-complex-plane-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/complex-plane-complex-plane-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.68,
      "size": 26928,
      "text": "拖动图中的点，观察它对应的复数如何变化。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "modulus-argument",
      "line_id": "modulus-argument-1",
      "filename": "modulus-argument-modulus-argument-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/modulus-argument-modulus-argument-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.67,
      "size": 26640,
      "text": "复数还有另一种表示方法：用模和辐角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "modulus-argument",
      "line_id": "modulus-argument-2",
      "filename": "modulus-argument-modulus-argument-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/modulus-argument-modulus-argument-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.53,
      "size": 40464,
      "text": "模是复数到原点的距离，用 r 表示，等于 a 平方加 b 平方的平方根。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "modulus-argument",
      "line_id": "modulus-argument-3",
      "filename": "modulus-argument-modulus-argument-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/modulus-argument-modulus-argument-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.33,
      "size": 37296,
      "text": "辐角是复数与正实轴的夹角，用希腊字母 θ 表示。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "modulus-argument",
      "line_id": "modulus-argument-4",
      "filename": "modulus-argument-modulus-argument-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/modulus-argument-modulus-argument-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "size": 44928,
      "text": "这样，复数可以写成 r 乘以括号 cos θ 加 i sin θ 的形式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "euler-formula",
      "line_id": "euler-formula-1",
      "filename": "euler-formula-euler-formula-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/euler-formula-euler-formula-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.0,
      "size": 47952,
      "text": "数学中最美的公式之一是欧拉公式：e 的 i θ 次方等于 cos θ 加 i sin θ。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "euler-formula",
      "line_id": "euler-formula-2",
      "filename": "euler-formula-euler-formula-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/euler-formula-euler-formula-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.01,
      "size": 32112,
      "text": "这个公式把指数函数和三角函数神奇地联系在一起。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "euler-formula",
      "line_id": "euler-formula-3",
      "filename": "euler-formula-euler-formula-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/euler-formula-euler-formula-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.16,
      "size": 50544,
      "text": "当 θ 等于 π 时，我们得到欧拉恒等式：e 的 i π 次方加 1 等于 0。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "euler-formula",
      "line_id": "euler-formula-4",
      "filename": "euler-formula-euler-formula-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/euler-formula-euler-formula-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46800,
      "text": "这个等式包含了数学中最重要的五个常数：0、1、e、i 和 π。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "multiplication",
      "line_id": "multiplication-1",
      "filename": "multiplication-multiplication-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/multiplication-multiplication-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.35,
      "size": 21600,
      "text": "复数乘法有一个美妙的几何意义。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "multiplication",
      "line_id": "multiplication-2",
      "filename": "multiplication-multiplication-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/multiplication-multiplication-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.76,
      "size": 28224,
      "text": "两个复数相乘，模相乘，辐角相加。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "multiplication",
      "line_id": "multiplication-3",
      "filename": "multiplication-multiplication-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/multiplication-multiplication-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "size": 29520,
      "text": "这意味着乘以一个复数，相当于旋转加缩放！"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "multiplication",
      "line_id": "multiplication-4",
      "filename": "multiplication-multiplication-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/multiplication-multiplication-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.86,
      "size": 29808,
      "text": "特别地，乘以 i 相当于逆时针旋转 90 度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "multiplication",
      "line_id": "multiplication-5",
      "filename": "multiplication-multiplication-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/multiplication-multiplication-5.mp3",
      "duration": 3.14,
      "size": 50256,
      "text": "这就解释了为什么 i 的平方等于负1：旋转两次 90 度就是 180 度，正好变成相反数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "applications",
      "line_id": "applications-1",
      "filename": "applications-applications-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/applications-applications-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.26,
      "size": 20160,
      "text": "复数在很多领域都有重要应用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "applications",
      "line_id": "applications-2",
      "filename": "applications-applications-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/applications-applications-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.72,
      "size": 27504,
      "text": "电气工程中，交流电路分析大量使用复数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "applications",
      "line_id": "applications-3",
      "filename": "applications-applications-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/applications-applications-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.65,
      "size": 26352,
      "text": "量子力学中，波函数就是复数值函数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "applications",
      "line_id": "applications-4",
      "filename": "applications-applications-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/applications-applications-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "size": 24048,
      "text": "信号处理中，傅里叶变换的结果是复数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-1",
      "filename": "summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.25,
      "size": 20016,
      "text": "让我们总结一下今天学到的内容。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-2",
      "filename": "summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.78,
      "size": 28512,
      "text": "复数是实部加虚部的形式，可以在复平面上表示。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-3",
      "filename": "summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.82,
      "size": 29088,
      "text": "复数的模是到原点的距离，辐角是与实轴的夹角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-4",
      "filename": "summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.43,
      "size": 22896,
      "text": "复数乘法的几何意义是旋转和缩放。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "complex",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-5",
      "filename": "summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/complex/yunxi/summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "size": 29376,
      "text": "希望通过这个实验，你对复数有了更直观的理解！"
    }
  ],
